# The cleaner (zone_residential_west). Package A3 "Rats": JobAccepted(rats), rats_paid, cleaner_went_down.
# Proof the sewers are clear: the sewer rats each carry a rat_tail; fewer than 5 living tails means 6+ are dead.
# (Killed(rat) is not a counter in the engine; see the package report.)

%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: HasFlag('cleaner_called') && !HasFlag('clinic_cleaned')
goto: Working

cond: HasFlag('rats_paid')
goto: Paid

cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(rats)') && (HasFlag('sewer_rats_poisoned') || ItemCountFactionInventorySinglePrefix('rat_tail', 'zone_residential_south_underground', 'rats') <= 4)
goto: Proof

cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(rats)')
goto: Waiting

cond: true
goto: Idle

%rec: Nodes
%type: npc multiline

name: Idle
npc: (A tired man in stained coveralls sits on his bed, phone in hand.)
+ Blood, puke, worse. You make a mess, somebody calls me. Always somebody calls me.
#
o_text: Somebody called you about the sewer rats.
o_id: ask_rats
o_goto: RatJob
#
o_text: Carry on.
o_id: bye
o_goto: Bye

name: RatJob
npc: Southside sewers. Ten rats, big as dogs, and the district pays me to clear them. I'm not going down there.
+ You do it, the 150 is yours. Shoot them, poison them, I don't care. Bob sells poison. The rats feed off the trash heap down there.
#
o_text: Deal. Keep the money warm.
o_id: accept_rats
o_goto: AcceptRats
#
o_text: It's your job. Go down and do it.
o_id: do_your_job
o_test: RollSkill('intimidate', 'Easy')
o_succ: GoesDown
o_fail: Refuses
#
o_text: Not my problem.
o_id: decline_rats
o_goto: Bye

name: AcceptRats
npc: Manhole behind Bob's store. Mind the mines, the Doc's people put them down there.
effect: SetFlag('JobAccepted(rats)')
#
o_text: Right.
o_id: accept_bye
o_goto: Bye

name: GoesDown
npc: (He looks at you for a long moment, then at his mop.) Fine. Fine. I'll go.
effect: SetFlag('cleaner_went_down')
effect: RunScript('a_cleaner_dies')
#
o_text: Good man.
o_id: go_bye
o_goto: Bye

name: Refuses
npc: No. I'd rather be poor than eaten. Get out of my room.
effect: EndConversation

name: Waiting
npc: Are they dead yet?
#
o_text: Working on it.
o_id: working_on_it
o_goto: Bye

name: Proof
npc: You smell like the sewer. That's a good sign.
#
o_text: The sewer's quiet. Pay up.
o_id: rats_done
o_goto: Paid
#
o_text: Later.
o_id: proof_later
o_goto: Bye

name: Paid
npc: (He counts it out slowly, like it hurts.) 150. Nobody has to know I never went down.
effect: PlayerAddGold(150)
effect: SetFlag('rats_paid')
#
o_text: Nobody will.
o_id: paid_bye
o_goto: Bye

name: Working
npc: (He doesn't look up from the floor.)
+ The new doc wants this place spotless before he sees patients. Mind your feet.
effect: EndConversation

name: Bye
npc: Yeah.
effect: EndConversation
